  "boundary": "Exact current registration, module/token joins and selected source operations establish structural-only finite framing. The member50 action interleaves independent vector/scalar/curve profiles, raw4 values, a byte payload and two nullable lists, then ends in thirteen independent bytes. Vector/scalar/curve profiles reuse buff_b2_native.json, buff_35_native.json and buff_24_native.json. List MethodSpec 610881 selects member1 elements, each containing a nullable list selected by MethodSpec 610880. Its member5 element consumes byte, signed-length byte payload, two DWORDs and raw4. Bound both list levels before looping; reserve the parent minimum remainder of 31 or 25 bytes at the two outer counts. Null wrappers, null lists, empty lists and null elements remain independent. Parent completion requires every final byte. Complete selected parent and nested method windows preserve initialization, normal/null paths and instruction boundaries. Camera state and condition meanings, live provider selection, full refill/error parity and whole-BuffData EOF remain unresolved."
